 2 water molecules using 4 electrons from cytochrome c in the IMS and 4 protons from the mitochondrial matrix."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}